<view class="page"
  ><view class="title">让提醒恰到好处</view
  ><view class="subtitle">这些设置控制应用内的提醒和互动消息。</view
  ><view class="card"
    ><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="item row"
      ><text>{{item.name}}</text
      ><switch
        color="#285548"
        checked="{{item.enabled}}"
        disabled="{{saving}}"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindchange="change" /></view></view
  ><view class="muted">可随时更改，关闭后不会生成新的对应互动提醒。</view></view
>
